      "text": "An update from Phillies on Brandon Marsh: Marsh underwent successful left wrist carpal boss excision surgery on Oct. 14 in Arizona. Marsh is expected to have a normal offseason, the team said. A source said Marsh has already resumed workouts following the minor surgery.",
